{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bPqt9_oYLalvFTFz-6_lzQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:23.415365+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bPqt9_oYLalvFTFz-6_lzQ","html":"<div><p><font><span><span>2025</span></span></font><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>8</span></span></font><font><span><span>月</span></span></font><font><span><span>17</span></span></font><font><span><span>日</span></span></font><font><span><span>-20</span></span></font><font><span><span>日，国防科技大学计算机学院将</span></span></font><font><span><span>主办</span></span></font><font><span><span>“量子人工智能暑期学校”，中国计算机学会（</span></span></font><font><span><span>CCF</span></span></font><font><span><span>）量子计算专业委员会支持。详情见海报。</span></span></font></p><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/MkwQ7xW5cUvHzZmzPG1VOcpc725mmvG5ATYLZ2REDSIKjRnBa4TEwsl7PEQHyAyQ8V2aWueADguMBuSrtyX5Fg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;randomid=utuugfzx&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><h1><span><span>国防科技大学2025年“量子人工智能”全国研究生暑期学校招生简章</span></span></h1><p><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年“量子人工智能”全国研究生暑期学校由国防科技大学计算机学院承办，邀请国内知名专家共同讲授量子人工智能领域的基础知识和前沿技术，现诚挚邀请相关高校和研究机构的研究生、博士后和青年教师参加。</span></span></p><p><span><span>一、时间地点</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>活动时间</span></span></span><span><span>:2025</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>-2025</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span><span>暂定</span></span></span><span><span>)</span></span></p><p><span><span>活动地点</span></span><span><span><span>:</span></span></span><span><span>国防科技大学长沙校区一号院</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xTjsNs5njw0p0u6cccaemtf5iafeKhceP5X8fVwbV8XENLyZZfq6TztfwgLBUxGzD9npibuvDTktAWnauZpyXctA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>三、报名条件和安排</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>招生对象</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>学历层次、学科专业等</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>量子计算、量子信息、物理、计算机、数学相关学科知识背景的高年级本科生、硕士生、博士生、青年教师和青年科研人</span></span></p><p><span><span>员。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>对能力素养的要求</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>科研成果、成绩排名</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>具有良好的创新能力、团队组织能力和沟通能力。根据学员的学术成果发表情况、科研项目经历、所获表彰奖励、校园活动及社会活动经历择优录取。</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>需提供相关证明材料</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>、报名渠道</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名表见招生简章未尾链接。请报名学员下载报名表如实填写，由学员所在的学校研究生院、教务处或所在院系审核盖章后扫描成</span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span>格式，连同加盖教学管理部门公章的成绩单扫描件</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>仅针对在读生</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span>发送至组委会邮箱，</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>邮件主题请参考</span></span><span><span><span>:2025</span></span></span><span><span>年“量子人工智能”全国研究生暑期学校</span></span><span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>截止时间和遴选方式等</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名截止时间</span></span><span><span><span>:2025</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>18:00</span></span></span><span><span>、择优录取学员</span></span><span><span><span>70</span></span></span><span><span>人。录取通知将在</span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span>日前通过短信或电子邮箱的方式通知学员本人，本人收到通知后需在</span></span><span><span><span>48</span></span></span><span><span>小时内回复确认是否参会，</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span>声明原则上不得无故放弃</span></span></p><p><span><span>四、费用安排</span></span></p><p><span><span>所有学员免收学费和资料费。在校学习期间，提供图书阅览、网络检索等必要的学习生活条件。非本校线下学员提供免费食宿，凭有关证件统一在国防科技大学餐厅就餐。学员往返差旅费用自行承担</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、申请材料清单</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.2025</span></span></span><span><span>年“量子人工智能”全国研究生暑期学校报名表</span></span><span><span><span>;</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>学生身份证复印件</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>份</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>将正反面复印在</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>张</span></span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span><span><span>纸上</span></span><span><span><span>);</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>成绩单及相关证明材料</span></span></p><p><span><span>六、其他注意事项</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>材料真实性要求。申请者必须保证所填报的各种信息和申请材料必须真实，若在申请与参加过程中存在弄虚作假或其他违规舞弊，一经发现即取消参加资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>相关纪律要求。暑期学校期间所有学员须严格遵守国防科技大学计算机学院有关规章制度和暑期学校的要求与纪律，遵守相关安排，按时参加活动，无故缺席者将被取消学员资格。</span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>想要了解更多关于量子领域的论文、教材、求职、升学、八卦、创业、企业、股票等信息，可关注公众号，或咨询鸡蛋老师微信386677854（务必备注“量子”）。</span></span></p></section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"4db78c3b389dcbbd270cc502b9c73bdb3b1f87f4a87018870d3ddd43ffc0cff6","textLength":1097,"sourceSha256":"0cfbf03fa31a1373ed319a72cb9363daa0cd011e1c767e91e4d3fb3f287e235c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a765550283fe9530f130","title":"2025年国防科技大学计算机学院2025年“量子人工智能”全国研究生暑期学校招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:23.415365+00:00"}
